1
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:23,870
Jiang Yu!

2
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:33,030
Jiang Yu!

3
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:44,880
Jiang Yu.

4
00:00:51,610 --> 00:00:52,430
Jiang Yu.

5
00:00:59,530 --> 00:01:00,320
Jiang Yu.

6
00:01:02,790 --> 00:01:03,600
Jiang Yu!

7
00:01:07,790 --> 00:01:08,510
Jiang Yu.

8
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:12,000
It's okay.

9
00:01:12,950 --> 00:01:13,880
Don't be afraid.

10
00:01:14,420 --> 00:01:16,220
I've already called the police.

11
00:01:17,990 --> 00:01:19,390
-Jiang Yu.
-Are you okay?

12
00:01:23,950 --> 00:01:25,280
-Be careful.
-Jiang Yu.

13
00:01:40,830 --> 00:01:45,259
♪In the darkness where there is no light,♪

14
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,120
You got hurt.

15
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:52,300
♪at the end of every lonely night,♪

16
00:01:52,750 --> 00:01:53,560
Go.

17
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:59,259
♪now my heart is beating once again.♪

18
00:01:54,430 --> 00:01:56,030
Go to the wedding as planned.

19
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:57,920
I'm fine.

20
00:01:58,509 --> 00:01:59,310
My leg is...

21
00:02:00,750 --> 00:02:05,950
♪Finally I'm breathing past the pain.♪

22
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,350
just a little off.

23
00:02:02,710 --> 00:02:05,150
Ahao will come to pick me up later.

24
00:02:05,870 --> 00:02:07,730
We just need to proceed as planned.

25
00:02:07,730 --> 00:02:10,850
♪In the winter breeze I feel your breath♪

26
00:02:10,889 --> 00:02:14,570
♪waken up my soul from frozen death,♪

27
00:02:12,150 --> 00:02:13,150
My bride,

28
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:21,810
♪like a miracle you came in view.♪

29
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:18,020
go win back everything that's yours.

30
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:21,430
Take back what belongs to you.

31
00:02:21,850 --> 00:02:28,420
♪At the edge of this breaking world,♪

32
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:32,660
♪you're the only one
who brought the light.♪

33
00:02:33,110 --> 00:02:35,810
♪Because it's you,♪

34
00:02:35,710 --> 00:02:38,120
I will definitely
make He Mu pay the price.

35
00:02:35,860 --> 00:02:37,360
♪all my sadness♪

36
00:02:37,420 --> 00:02:42,579
♪fading out of sight.♪

37
00:02:42,620 --> 00:02:48,010
♪In your arms I'm born again and new.♪

38
00:02:43,750 --> 00:02:44,560
Wait for me.

39
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:46,560
Go now.

40
00:03:08,210 --> 00:03:10,050
[Dearest Episode12]

41
00:03:21,930 --> 00:03:22,730
Jiang Yu.

42
00:03:26,930 --> 00:03:27,740
Jiang Yu.

43
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:31,800
Jiang Yu!

44
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:59,000
Dear relatives and friends,

45
00:03:59,079 --> 00:04:00,430
I'm really sorry to

46
00:04:00,430 --> 00:04:01,870
announce that

47
00:04:02,470 --> 00:04:04,400
due to unforeseen circumstances,

48
00:04:04,450 --> 00:04:07,040
today's wedding must be canceled.

49
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:21,450
Jianan,

50
00:04:22,430 --> 00:04:23,480
what's wrong with you?

51
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,270
Jianan.

52
00:04:28,840 --> 00:04:29,920
My wedding

53
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:32,840
is not over.

54
00:04:58,450 --> 00:05:00,810
My stepfather, He Mu,

55
00:05:01,830 --> 00:05:04,040
plotted to harm my husband and me.

56
00:05:08,260 --> 00:05:09,790
But I survived.

57
00:05:12,870 --> 00:05:13,670
So,

58
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,960
my wedding is not over.

59
00:05:20,190 --> 00:05:21,320
Play the recording.

60
00:05:21,670 --> 00:05:24,030
Mr. He, what do you want us to do?

61
00:05:24,820 --> 00:05:26,220
Blow up their wedding car

62
00:05:26,310 --> 00:05:28,310
and leave them with nowhere to rest.

63
00:05:33,340 --> 00:05:34,150
Jianan,

64
00:05:34,890 --> 00:05:36,430
why do you use a fake recording

65
00:05:36,430 --> 00:05:37,670
to frame Dad?

66
00:05:37,870 --> 00:05:38,720
Today is your wedding.

67
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:39,830
It's a good day.

68
00:05:39,830 --> 00:05:41,950
Please don't make this kind of joke, okay?

69
00:05:41,950 --> 00:05:44,080
Where did the explosion happen today?

70
00:05:44,310 --> 00:05:45,380
The whole city is peaceful.

71
00:05:45,380 --> 00:05:47,040
There was no explosion at all!

72
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,190
Mr. He.

73
00:06:00,970 --> 00:06:01,850
Mr. He,

74
00:06:02,230 --> 00:06:03,470
please come with us.

75
00:06:04,510 --> 00:06:05,310
Sir,

76
00:06:06,250 --> 00:06:07,930
there must be some mistake.

77
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:08,790
Mr. He,

78
00:06:09,210 --> 00:06:11,560
all your accomplices
have all been arrested.

79
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:13,070
We have solid evidence

80
00:06:13,280 --> 00:06:14,810
that prove you plotted to murder

81
00:06:14,810 --> 00:06:17,080
Wen Jianan and Jiang Yu.

82
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:18,390
The evidence also shows

83
00:06:18,390 --> 00:06:21,920
you are suspected of involvement in
the murder of Jiang Yuqing.

84
00:06:22,070 --> 00:06:22,870
Jianan,

85
00:06:22,910 --> 00:06:25,020
are you doing the same thing to me
as you did to your ex?

86
00:06:25,020 --> 00:06:26,680
Hiring people to put on a show?

87
00:06:27,230 --> 00:06:29,100
If you don't want to marry Jiang Yu,

88
00:06:29,100 --> 00:06:30,440
just tell Dad.

89
00:06:30,460 --> 00:06:31,930
Even if he is the boss of Cloudsea,

90
00:06:31,930 --> 00:06:33,140
you don't have to be afraid of him.

91
00:06:33,140 --> 00:06:34,800
How dare you mention Jiang Yu?

92
00:06:35,409 --> 00:06:37,330
He's your own son.

93
00:06:39,350 --> 00:06:40,880
What are you talking about?

94
00:06:50,790 --> 00:06:54,550
You had your own son get
close to me on purpose.

95
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:57,000
Just to take over the Wen family.

96
00:06:58,890 --> 00:07:00,850
Grandpa gave you the group.

97
00:07:02,030 --> 00:07:03,420
Mom gave you her heart.

98
00:07:03,440 --> 00:07:05,530
I gave you all my trust!

99
00:07:06,890 --> 00:07:08,370
We were so good to you.

100
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:11,360
Why did you do this?

101
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:23,600
I will love you for him.

102
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:31,760
You used your own son to
play with my feelings

103
00:07:31,780 --> 00:07:32,950
and move into home.

104
00:07:33,290 --> 00:07:35,170
Just to take over the Wen family.

105
00:07:35,750 --> 00:07:37,480
Why did you do this to us?

106
00:07:37,630 --> 00:07:38,560
You're crazy.

107
00:07:38,830 --> 00:07:40,890
What nonsense are you talking about?

108
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:46,430
You wolf-hearted schemer.

109
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:51,320
No, you have no heart at all!

110
00:07:52,850 --> 00:07:55,330
You don't deserve to be a good husband,

111
00:07:55,650 --> 00:07:57,290
let alone a good father!

112
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,510
You're crazy!

113
00:07:59,310 --> 00:08:00,070
Everyone, let me explain!

114
00:08:00,070 --> 00:08:01,650
Don't listen to her nonsense!

115
00:08:01,650 --> 00:08:03,210
Go explain it to the police.

116
00:08:06,830 --> 00:08:08,390
Mrs. Wen, please calm down!

117
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,970
So it really was you who killed him.

118
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:17,080
Xin, who are you talking about?

119
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:21,430
Who do you mean?

120
00:08:21,430 --> 00:08:22,270
Chenghan.

121
00:08:23,960 --> 00:08:26,290
My love, from twenty years ago, Chenghan!

122
00:08:27,300 --> 00:08:29,590
You gave our volcanic stone ring

123
00:08:29,860 --> 00:08:31,740
to your first love,

124
00:08:32,570 --> 00:08:34,450
and then married me.

125
00:08:35,260 --> 00:08:36,740
You really disgust me!

126
00:08:36,770 --> 00:08:37,679
I didn't!

127
00:08:45,010 --> 00:08:46,610
Go pay for him with your life.

128
00:08:51,220 --> 00:08:53,170
Dad, Dad, save me.

129
00:08:53,230 --> 00:08:54,540
I did so much for you.

130
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:55,280
Shut up!

131
00:08:57,390 --> 00:09:00,790
You've been scheming against
the Wen family and me all along!

132
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:03,640
We don't have a son-in-law like you!

133
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:04,840
Take him away!

134
00:09:08,670 --> 00:09:10,470
Mr. He, please.

135
00:09:28,220 --> 00:09:29,100
Come find me.

136
00:09:30,190 --> 00:09:32,310
I will tell you the truth,

137
00:09:33,020 --> 00:09:35,350
including who your biological father is.

138
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,000
Jianan.

139
00:09:57,560 --> 00:09:58,440
Are you okay?
